  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℝ</mi></semantics></math>. Với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>±</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tDo đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là một hàm số tuần hoàn.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>105</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>135</mn></mrow></semantics></math> với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy chỉ số huyết áp của người đó là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>135</mn><mi>/</mi><mn>105</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
